desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Aws Fsx Lustre Encrypted With Cmk"
	title_zh: "检测到 AWS FSx Lustre 文件系统未使用 KMS CMK 加密",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-aws-fsx-lustre-filesystem-encrypted-with-cmk"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Ensure FSX Lustre file system is encrypted at rest using KMS CMKs. CMKs gives you control over the encryption key in terms of access and rotation.

### 风险类型
安全配置不当（security-misconfiguration）

### 影响
安全相关配置缺失或过于宽松，可能暴露敏感功能或降低整体防护能力。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: context-aware regex — fsx resource blocks are dropped when they contain a `kms_key_id` assignment (pattern-not-inside approximation via overlap removal).

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-200: Exposure of Sensitive Information to an Unauthorized Actor
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按最小权限原则收紧配置，显式启用安全选项，并定期审计配置项。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.tf": <<<POS
resource "aws_fsx_lustre_file_system" "fail" {
  storage_capacity            = 1200
  subnet_ids                  = [aws_subnet.test1.id]
  deployment_type             = "PERSISTENT_1"
  per_unit_storage_throughput = 50
  YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-aws-fsx-lustre-filesystem-encrypted-with-cmk
}
POS
	"safefile://neg.tf": <<<NEG
resource "aws_fsx_lustre_file_system" "pass" {
  storage_capacity            = 1200
  subnet_ids                  = [aws_subnet.test1.id]
  deployment_type             = "PERSISTENT_1"
  per_unit_storage_throughput = 50
  kms_key_id                  = aws_kms_key.test1.arn
}
NEG
)

${*.tf}.pattern_regex(/resource\s+"aws_fsx_lustre_file_system"\s+"[^"]*"\s*\{[\s\S]*?\}/) as $b
${*.tf}.pattern_regex(/resource\s+"aws_fsx_lustre_file_system"\s+"[^"]*"\s*\{[\s\S]*?kms_key_id\s*=[\s\S]*?\}/) as $k
$b - $k as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Aws Fsx Lustre Encrypted With Cmk",
	title_zh: "检测到 AWS FSx Lustre 文件系统未使用 KMS CMK 加密",
	message: "Ensure FSX Lustre file system is encrypted at rest using KMS CMKs.",
}
